#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
fpgatest -- one command to test a remotely-built bitstream on a locally-attached
Blackboard, from an Apple Silicon Mac.

    Mac (this machine)                          CES server (hiwi-node)
    ------------------                          ----------------------
    Blackboard --USB--> xvcd :LOCAL
                          ^
                          |  ssh -R REMOTE:127.0.0.1:LOCAL
                          +------------------- hw_server -e "...xilinx-xvc:127.0.0.1:REMOTE"
                                                          ^
    UART capture <--USB-- (FT2232 ch. B)                  |
                                                        xsdb
    fpgatest ---------------- ssh ------------------> remote_agent.py

Only JTAG transactions and a few kilobytes of JSON cross the network. The
bitstream itself never leaves the server it was built on.
"""

